sections.body:
We use the information described above to:
- Provide, operate, and maintain the Game;
- Save your in-game progress on your device and in the cloud, so it can be restored;
- Process in-app purchases, deliver the items you bought, and restore them when needed;
- Show advertisements and measure their performance;
- Detect, diagnose, and fix crashes, bugs, and performance issues;
- Understand how players use the Game so we can improve levels and features.
